<p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;">
REAL-WORLD CONNECTION: Schools Creating AI Policies
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
As generative AI tools have become more common, many schools and districts have had to create new policies about when students should - and should not - use AI for schoolwork.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
Some schools allow AI for brainstorming or revision but not for completing assignments independently. Others require students to explain how AI was used during the creation process.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;">
Students explore similar questions throughout the unit as they build their own evidence-based guidance for responsible AI use.
</p>

</div>
